    "id": "M2_current_assignment_and_statistical_or_derived_postal_area_visualization",
    "definition": "Current rights-cleared complete-for-declared-coverage four-digit assignments with stable edition, validity, schema and SHA-256 must reproducibly produce an approved immutable artifact and pass the actual AT AGID loader, API and app. A drawable area must be an exact operator area, an official-statistical postcode Polygon/MultiPolygon, or a clearly derived surface from complete permitted address members. It retains geometry authority, official/derived/virtual class, basis date, confidence, omissions and uncertainty and passes normalized search, multiple/no-result/failure states, fit, translucent fill, clear outline and clear/re-search. Address, destination-location, district, municipality, building, route, P.O. box, organization, buffer, Voronoi, learned and AGID geometry never become official full-code polygons. House numbers and buildings require separate permitted stable address relations. Synthetic fixtures, WMS pictures, format examples, public webpages and metadata alone never establish M2."
  },
